  "demand_rationale": "Keeping 100 requests isolates fleet size at fixed demand but halves requests per vehicle (8.33 to 4.17) and doubles above-reserve energy. Doubling to 200 requests keeps requests per vehicle at 8.33 and isolates scale. Both are needed; with the same seed, V12R100 and V24R100 receive identical request sets (workload depends only on seed and request count), so the fleet-size contrast is exactly matched.",
  "charging_note": "Charging rules unchanged: each idle vehicle at its home depot charges independently (1,500 W DC), no charger queue or site power cap. With 24 vehicles on three depots this is more optimistic than with 12; stated as a limitation.",
